<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lord of life, beneath the dome</l><l>Of the universe, Thy home,</l><l>Gather us, who seek Thy face,</l><l>To the fold of Thy embrace,</l><l>For Thou art nigh.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>While the deepening shadows fall,</l><l>Heart of love, enfolding all,</l><l>Through the glory and the grace</l><l>Of the stars that veil Thy face,</l><l>Our hearts ascend.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
